        <section class="g t-ink" id="about" data-sec="B" style="--cm:3;--cd:8">
          <div class="vl" aria-hidden="true">{L.map((i) => <i style={`--i:${i}`} />)}</div>
          <p class="c lab mono" style="--am:1/1/span 1/span 3;--ad:1/1/span 1/span 8"><span>B — Who's holding the camera</span></p>
          <p class="c say" data-snap style="--am:2/1/span var(--rs,7)/span 3;--ad:2/1/span var(--rs,4)/span 6"><span class="in" style="display:block">I'm Oscar. I've hosted <em>40+ events</em>, been to <em>100+ more</em>, and shot for teams like OpenAI and Vercel — so I know every side of the room.</span></p>
          <p class="c body2" data-snap style="--am:auto/1/span var(--rs,3)/span 3;--ad:2/7/span var(--rs,4)/span 2"><span class="in" style="display:block">Organiser, guest, photographer: I've been all three, often on the same night. I know what the run sheet needs, which moments people actually share, and how to get them without getting in the way. Mostly startup and tech events, but product shoots, sports, launch videos and other odd bits too.</span></p>
        </section>

        <section class="g t-paper" id="work" data-sec="C" style="--cm:6;--cd:16">
          <div class="vl" aria-hidden="true">{L.map((i) => <i style={`--i:${i}`} />)}</div>
          <p class="c lab mono" style="--am:1/1/span 1/span 6;--ad:1/1/span 1/span 16"><span>C — Selects</span><b>24 frames · tap any</b></p>
          <h2 class="cap" style="--am:2/1/span 1/span 6;--ad:2/1/span 2/span 12">Selects</h2>
          <p class="c body2" data-snap style="--am:3/1/span var(--rs,2)/span 6;--ad:2/13/span 2/span 4"><span class="in">Mostly events — hackathons, demo nights, launches — plus the odd product shoot. Tap any frame to open it.</span></p>
        </section>
        <section class="g t-paper" data-sec="C" aria-label="selected photos" style="--cm:6;--cd:16">
